  "description": "Built to kick ass on dirt roads and obliterate your opponents on tarmac, the HVRT CF1 is a high-end model featuring the SRAM Rival AXS group set. The bike rolls out of the factory on Rondo X HUNT Carbon Limitless wheels with extra-wide aero carbon rims – perfect for high-speed action on smooth roads. But if you have the urge to venture off road, the bike is ready to take 650B wheels with anything up to 47mm tires, transforming the HVRT into a full-on offroad beast. On top of that, the unique TwinTip Carbon fork allows you to change your riding position and character of the bike to suit your preferences and the terrain you plan to attack. There really is no bike out there that can match the versatility of the HVRT – and this high end build is a real treat for any real cycling enthusiast.",
